        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Industrial residue wood, 3-layered LB production, softwood, u=20%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Industrial residue wood, 3-layered LB production, softwood, u=20%, at plant
The multi-output process "three layered laminated board, production" delivers the two coproducts "three layered laminated board, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, 3-layered LB production, softwood, u=20%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: 55a20b58-5eda-36a2-b48a-604b505c091d
Includes the inputs to the production processes and transports of those inputs. No process emission data are available.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Medium enterprised technology (1995)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the technology is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_55a20b58-5eda-36a2-b48a-604b505c091d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
